<title>BELGIUM: CORLUY SHIFTS BELFOX CLEARING BUSINESS TO DEGROOF.</title>
<headline>CORLUY SHIFTS BELFOX CLEARING BUSINESS TO DEGROOF.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belfox market-maker and broker Corluy &amp; Co has transferred its clearing activities to Banque Degroof, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the deal marked a new departure for the two, offering fresh opportunities for each.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
